+          );
+        }
         // Fix #6 (round-1 finding, P2 — wiring): a side-effect that fails
         // AFTER its marker is written was previously reported ONLY in this
         // local `outcomes` line — invisible outside this one CLI invocation's
         // stdout. Route it through the SAME `gaps` mechanism already used for
